<title>UK: BA traffic statistics detailed.</title>
<headline>BA traffic statistics detailed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways cargo carried in June grew by 8.1 percent in cargo tonne kilometres (CTKs) compared to year ago data, BA said in its monthly traffic report.</p>
<p>The airline said the growth in traffic was achieved despite the adverse effects of disruption at Charles de Gaulle airport in Paris, and the continuing ban on British registered aircraft operating into Nigeria.</p>
